==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
